  "result": "Perfect! All 256 tests pass. The late fee feature is complete.\n\n**What was implemented:**\n- Added `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` to src/reports.js\n- Calculates late fee at 0.04% per day of the amount still due\n- Returns 0 if:\n  - Invoice is draft\n  - Invoice is not yet overdue (dueDate \u2265 asOf)\n  - No amount is due (fully paid or overpaid)\n- Formula: late fee = (due \u00d7 daysOverdue \u00d7 0.0004), rounded to nearest cent\n- daysOverdue = daysBetween(dueDate, asOf) when dueDate < asOf\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n- No fee when not overdue\n- No fee when due on asOf date\n- Fee calculation for overdue invoices\n- Correct rate (0.04% per day)\n- Fee accumulation with days overdue\n- No fee for draft invoices\n- No fee for paid invoices\n- Fee accounting for partial payments\n- No fee for fully paid invoices\n- Proper rounding to integer cents\n- Works with different payment terms (NET14, EOM, NET30)\n- Works with complex invoices (discounts, VAT)\n- Always returns integer cents\n- Fee increases with longer delays\n\nAll 256 tests pass (241 previous + 15 new).",
